   "id": "t006",
   "x": 52,
   "y": 207,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 420,
   "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "platform/comm_matrix.yaml\n\nnetwork:\n  subnet: 172.30.0.0/24\n  multicast_route: 224.0.0.0/4     # o Docker NAO cria\n  service_discovery:\n    multicast: 224.244.224.245  port: 30490  ttl: 3\n    cyclic_offer_delay: 2000\n\nservices:\n  GnssService:\n    id: 0x1234        instance: 0x5678\n    port: 30509       # unreliable (UDP)\n    events:\n      - Position  0x8777  field  cycle 2000ms\n      - Velocity  0x8778  field\n      - Status    0x8779  field\n    eventgroups:\n      - 0x4455  [Position, Velocity]\n      - 0x4465  [Velocity, Status]\n                multicast 224.225.226.233:32344\n      - 0x4555  [Position, Status]\n\nnodes:\n  gnss_ecu:  ip 172.30.0.11   app 0x1277\n             role: sensor      provides: GnssService\n  hmi_ecu:   ip 172.30.0.12   app 0x1343\n             role: consumidor  consumes: GnssService",
   "originalText": "platform/comm_matrix.yaml\n\nnetwork:\n  subnet: 172.30.0.0/24\n  multicast_route: 224.0.0.0/4     # o Docker NAO cria\n  service_discovery:\n    multicast: 224.244.224.245  port: 30490  ttl: 3\n    cyclic_offer_delay: 2000\n\nservices:\n  GnssService:\n    id: 0x1234        instance: 0x5678\n    port: 30509       # unreliable (UDP)\n    events:\n      - Position  0x8777  field  cycle 2000ms\n      - Velocity  0x8778  field\n      - Status    0x8779  field\n    eventgroups:\n      - 0x4455  [Position, Velocity]\n      - 0x4465  [Velocity, Status]\n                multicast 224.225.226.233:32344\n      - 0x4555  [Position, Status]\n\nnodes:\n  gnss_ecu:  ip 172.30.0.11   app 0x1277\n             role: sensor      provides: GnssService\n  hmi_ecu:   ip 172.30.0.12   app 0x1343\n             role: consumidor  consumes: GnssService",
