   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "libecu · fachada ara::com sobre vsomeip\nSkeleton -> offer_service/notify    ·    Proxy -> request_service/subscribe/send    ·    Event<T> -> eventgroup\nField<T> -> metodo + evento    ·    Method<Req,Res> -> REQUEST/RESPONSE    ·    InstanceSpecifier -> service id + instance id",
